       fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Relates a manufactured drug product to the non-proprietary (generic) representation of its ingredients independent of strength, and form.          The scoping entity identifies a unique combination of medicine ingredients; sometimes referred to as \"ingredient set\"." ] ;
       fhir:CodeSystem.concept.concept [
