         fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "Relates a manufactured drug product to the non-proprietary (generic) representation of its ingredients and dose form, independent of strength of the ingredients. The scoping entity identifies a unique combination of medicine ingredients in a specific dose form." ]
       ], [
